SUMMARY:Private Screening: "Tony" 
LOCATION:Offsite: Boston Common Theater
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Waitlist On
 ly\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199856\n\n6:30PM Do
 ors Open\, 7:00PM Screening \nJoin us for a ‘Quin-exclusive private scr
 eening of Tony\, the story of 19-year-old Anthony Bourdain who travels to 
 Provincetown and stumbles into the chaotic\, intoxicating world of a resta
 urant kitchen\, setting off a summer that will shape the course of his lif
 e.\n\nThrown into a world of colorful characters\, late nights\, hard work
 \, and reckless camaraderie\, Tony begins to discover a sense of purpose a
 nd belonging he never expected. What starts as a summer job becomes a form
 ative coming-of-age experience\, awakening his fascination with food\, kit
 chen culture\, and the people who inhabit it—and laying the foundation f
 or the chef\, writer\, and storyteller he would eventually become.\n\n*Thi
 s event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one registered gu
 est. Food and beverage will be available for purchase at nearby concession
 s. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to
  the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199856
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
