SUMMARY:Mahjong Open Play 
LOCATION:Bondo
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unlim
 ited\nTime: 10 AM – 2 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/199496\n\nHave a love for the game\, the strategy\, and the social ri
 tual of Mahjong? Join us in Bondo for an open play afternoon designed for 
 members with a sound knowledge of Mahjong gameplay and an appetite for spi
 rited competition and connection.\n\nSettle in for a few rounds\, meet fel
 low players\, and enjoy an afternoon centered around the game. While food 
 will not be served during play\, we invite members to continue the afterno
 on over lunch at Café Q or Lunasol. The perfect way to turn a few games i
 nto an afternoon of conversation and connection.\n\n*This event is complim
 entary and reserved for members only. Mahjong mats\, tiles\, shufflers\, a
 nd racks will be provided\; however\, members are encouraged to bring thei
 r own current National Mah Jongg League scorecard. We kindly ask that all 
 cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
